valign="top" charoff="50">1.015&#x02013;1.147</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Impairments on sleep/rest (SIP-SR)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">0.008 (0.004)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1.008</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold>0.045</bold></td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">1.000&#x02013;1.015</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Physical activity</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">&#x02212;0.284 (0.115)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.752</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold>0.013</bold></td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">0.601&#x02013;0.943</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Constant</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">&#x02212;2.986 (1.040)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.051</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.004</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t4-fn1"><label/><p>(<italic>R</italic><sup>2</sup> was 0.274 (Cox &#x00026; Snell) and 0.412 (Nagelkerke)). A two-sided <italic>P</italic>&#x0003c;0.05 was considered significant.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>